### 🟢 Create Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Safety Gloves",
  "description": "High-quality protective gloves for industrial use",
  "price": 12.50,
  "category": "EQUIPMENT",
  "unit": "PAIR",
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "supplierId": 1
}

###

### 🟢 Get All Products (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 🟢 Get Product By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/10
Accept: application/json

###

### 🟡 Update Product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Gloves",
  "description": "Updated industrial gloves with extra protection",
  "price": 15.75,
  "category": "EQUIPMENT",
  "unit": "PAIR",
  "stockQuantity": 200,
  "supplierId": 1
}

###

### 🔍 Search Products by Name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=gloves
Accept: application/json

###

### 🧾 Get Products by Supplier
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/supplier/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 🗂 Get Products by Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/EQUIPMENT
Accept: application/json

###

### ⚠️ Get Low-Stock Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/low-stock?threshold=50
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔴 Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json
